{
  "language_code": "eng",
  "language_probability": 1.0,
  "text": "Level 100, 4,500 meters. This is Apex Bastion, fortress of the Praetorian Guard. Three meters of obsidian alloy, plasma guns covering the courtyard. They have turned the summit into a killing ground. The clouds are below us. Ice on the parapets, crosswinds over the rail. Stay away from those edges. Heavy signatures ahead. Praetorian shock troops and cyber samurai, the commander's personal guard. They know we are here. Their comms are silent. No panic. They know the nexus is gone, and they mean to hold this wall anyway. The stairway leads to the throne room. Artillery at the perimeter gate. We will need every operative to break through. Colossal war chassis at the gatehouse. Bastion Praetor, the last mechanized guardian between us and the commander. We broke the registry, emptied the grave, and brought their sky shields down. We are not stopping at the front door. Through the guard, through the Praetor, and on to the throne. Axiom force, blades drawn. Breach the Bastion.",
